<!-- =====================================================================
     LUMINAX / LUMI  -  Robot Description (Accurate Physical Model)
     ROS 2 Jazzy

     Modeled with exact measurements from physical robot photos using a
     15 cm DOMS engineering scale reference.

     Physical Specifications:
       - Drive Type: 4WD Skid-Steer (4 x Yellow DC TT Gear Motors)
       - Wheels: 65mm dia x 26mm width (Yellow rims + Black treaded tires)
       - Wheel Separation (Track Width): 0.178 m (center-to-center)
       - Wheelbase (Front-to-Rear Axle): 0.145 m
       - Lower Deck: 0.190 m x 0.140 m black acrylic chassis
       - Standoffs: 0.040 m (40 mm) brass hex spacers
       - Upper Deck: 0.180 m x 0.165 m white acrylic mounting deck
       - 2D LiDAR: Slamtec RPLiDAR A1 on elevated black mount
